      "updated": 1776014678072,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " Upload + Metadata (parallel). Frontend fires\nboth simultaneously — file goes direct to\nSupabase Storage via the pre-signed URL,\nmetadata hits FastAPI and gets stored on the\njob row. Neither waits for the other.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "cRtxi-GAN5F0w9O8dCXBG",
      "originalText": " Upload + Metadata (parallel). Frontend fires both simultaneously — file goes direct to Supabase Storage via the pre-signed URL, metadata hits FastAPI and gets stored on the job row. Neither waits for the other.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
