      "text": "Confirm + Charge. Frontend calls /confirm once\nboth Phase 3 calls succeed. FastAPI verifies\nthe file landed in the bucket, writes a -1 to the\nledger, updates the job to queued, then calls\nprocess_file.delay(job_id) to hand off to Celery.\nToken only leaves the user's account at this\npoint.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z-7MH_UAIbEhBJ0gny8A9",
      "originalText": "Confirm + Charge. Frontend calls /confirm once both Phase 3 calls succeed. FastAPI verifies the file landed in the bucket, writes a -1 to the ledger, updates the job to queued, then calls process_file.delay(job_id) to hand off to Celery. Token only leaves the user's account at this point.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
